","blurb":"215ft plunge, taller than Niagara. Flat 0.75mi gorge trail to the base.","town":"Trumansburg","indoor":false,"drive":"30 min from Ithaca","url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/62/"},{"name":"Robert H. Treman State Park","blurb":"Swim at the base of Lower Falls. Gorge trail passes 12 waterfalls.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"15 min from Ithaca","url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/135/"},{"name":"Watkins Glen State Park","blurb":"19 waterfalls in 2 miles of stone stairs and tunnels. The famous one.","town":"Watkins Glen","indoor":false,"drive":"45 min from Ithaca","url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/142/"},{"name":"Cascadilla Gorge Trail","blurb":"Six waterfalls climbing from downtown Ithaca up to Cornell. Short and steep.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/our-gardens/natural-areas/cascadilla-gorge/"},{"name":"Ithaca Farmers Market","blurb":"Waterfront pavilion at Steamboat Landing. Sat 9-3, Sun 10-3. Food stalls, not just produce.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://ithacamarket.com/"},{"name":"Cornell Botanic Gardens","blurb":"Free. Herb garden, arboretum, and the Slim Jim Woods trails.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/"},{"name":"Stewart Park","blurb":"Cayuga Lake shoreline, carousel, big shade trees. Easy with no plan.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.cityofithaca.org/234/Stewart-Park"},{"name":"Lime Hollow Nature Center","blurb":"Boardwalks, bog, treehouse. Closest real nature to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"10 min from Cortland","url":"https://limehollow.org/"},{"name":"Greek Peak Mountain Coaster","blurb":"Alpine coaster you control. Also a zipline and adventure center.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"15 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.greekpeak.net/"},{"name":"Cayuga Lake Wine Trail","blurb":"Tasting rooms up both shores. Sheldrake Point and Six Mile Creek are the easy picks.","town":"Cayuga Lake","indoor":false,"drive":"20-50 min","url":"https://cayugawinetrail.com/"},{"name":"Museum of the Earth","blurb":"Full mastodon and a right whale skeleton. Good rain plan, about 2 hours.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"30 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.museumoftheearth.org/"},{"name":"Herbert F. Johnson Museum of Art","blurb":"Free. I.M. Pei building, and the 5th floor has the best view of Cayuga Lake.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in Cornell campus","url":"https://museum.cornell.edu/"},{"name":"Sciencenter","blurb":"Hands-on science museum. Built for kids but the outdoor mini golf is fun regardless.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.sciencenter.org/"},{"name":"Center Ithaca / Ithaca Commons","blurb":"Food court with the soup dumplings, plus the pedestrian mall shops.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.downtownithaca.com/"},{"name":"Cortland Beer Company","blurb":"Small taproom downtown Cortland. Closest good beer to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"5 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.cortlandbeer.com/"},{"name":"1890 House Museum","blurb":"Chateau-style mansion with a tower you can climb. Right in Cortland.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"5 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.the1890house.org/"},{"name":"Cortland Repertory Theatre","blurb":"Summer stock at the Pavilion in Little York Lake. Check what is running.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"15 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.cortlandrep.org/"}],"links":[{"label":"Waterfalls","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/nq3a5m/waterfalls_outside_ithaca_that_dont_require_much/"},{"label":"Food","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/1k683oo/best_food_for_out_of_towners_ex_locals/"}],"photos":["photo-20260815-185114-7tqjd0.jpg","photo-20260815-175418-9uy4cz.jpg","photo-20260815-155043-vp56kk.jpg","